From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 03:04:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 32/39] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20wire=20plain-English=20custom=20t?=
 =?UTF-8?q?rackers=20into=20Settings=20+=20the=20live=20matcher=20(M18=20?=
